# core font files for tc-lib-pdf-font

This folder contains font files and/or font data extracted from:
https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-font-core14-afms
using the "bulk_convert.php" utility in https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-lib-pdf-font

The original files (if present) have been renamed and compressed using the ZLIB data format (.z files).
The files contain font metrics converted from the Adobe AFM files, not the AFM files themselves.
The font files and data are distributed under the terms in the LICENSE file, including any notice and exception stated there.
For further information please consult the original documentation at the link above.

